<title>CANADA: CAODC weekly western Canadian rig count - Nov 26.</title>
<headline>CAODC weekly western Canadian rig count - Nov 26.</headline>
<text>
<p>WEEK OF NOVEMBER 26 VERSUS NOVEMBER 19, 1996	   DRILLING</p>
<p>	     MOVING  RIGGING  DRILLING   DOWN    TOTAL   YR AGO</p>
<p> ALBERTA   16/17    1/1     291/279   40/51   348/348    222</p>
